WHAT
  dashboard of crime data for lincoln, nebraska, january 1990 to
  today. plotly.js chart.

DATA
  crime data from the lincoln police website, in data/ as excel.
  population estimates for per-capita numbers from the lincoln city
  website, in data/ as pdf.

  police:     https://www.lincoln.ne.gov/city/police/activityindex.htm
  population:  https://lincoln.ne.gov/city/plan/reports/reports/popest.pdf

